10041000/moriagaranai-date-chapter-41"},{"title":"Chapter 42","chapterNum":"42","chapterId":"mangapill-ch-%2Fchapters%2F9404-10042000%2Fmoriagaranai-date-chapter-42","html":null,"isVisualManga":true,"chUrl":"/chapters/9404-10042000/moriagaranai-date-chapter-42"}],"metadata":{"title":"Moriagaranai Date","altTitle":"Unexciting Date...","author":"Manga Artist","artist":"","year":"2024","status":"publishing","genres":["Comedy","Josei","Romance","Slice","of","Life"],"synopsis":"Haida, cursed with chronic bad luck, signs up for a dating app as part of her “what-the-heck” phase. She matches with Kuroi, a man who joined for equally reckless reasons. But their conversation never quite clicks, and an unmistakably low-key, awkward mood sets in. Everything they do backfires, resulting in a date that is astonishingly unexciting. Thinking there’s no way there’ll be a second date in an atmosphere like this… wait, what? Why are they making plans to meet again!?\n\nA first date with someone you met on a dating app that just doesn’t take off? The deadpan, surreal banter is way too addictive! A slow-burn, gently unfolding romance that begins with a dating app.\n\n(Source: COMICSMART, translated)","cover":"/api/proxy/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.readdetectiveconan.com%2Ffile%2Fmangapill%2Fi%2F9404.jpeg%3Fh%3D019b2b5f-5547-7e5b-8a75-60d959dac3cd","image":"/api/proxy/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.readdetectiveconan.com%2Ffile%2Fmangapill%2Fi%2F9404.jpeg%3Fh%3D019b2b5f-5547-7e5b-8a75-60d959dac3cd"},"type":"manga","format":"Manga & Manhwa","source":"Mangapill"}